        ],
        "page": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "我要让声音出现：FFmpeg的探索",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1
          }
        },
        "parent_id": ""
      },
      {
        "block_id": "IYPLd2XUHoSl7axWWzncEmfsnUe",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "Dl9AwLokeiI4YGkXIuZcQVqnn1d",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "      关于电影剪辑先按下不表，我只用了一两天就解决了剪辑技术层面的问题，只剩下剪辑的各种创意了，很快我有了新的目标。",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "YRXGdx1haop8HXxyCF6cvWRwnNg",
        "block_type": 2,
        "parent_id": "Dl9AwLokeiI4YGkXIuZcQVqnn1d",
        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "      我很爱看电影，我想把硬盘里的4K高码率资源放到电视上看，因为当时我手头上的4K显示器只有电视。我最初的想法是格式化我的小U盘，让电视识别他然后读取里面的资源（因为我的移动硬盘装了太多东西，不方便格式化）结果怎么样都没有声音，只有视频画面。",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "align": 1,
            "folded": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "block_id": "JXfgdn5XiososuxJw9IcMiCGnPc",
        "block_type": 24,
        "children": [
          "Ejt3dpy6eomaA7xnhspctupjnih",
          "DvzFd6anHoOBvCxEVDHcR8rwnsc"
        ],
        "grid": {
          "column_size": 2
        },
        "parent_id": "Dl9AwLokeiI4YGkXIuZcQVqnn1d"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "Ejt3dpy6eomaA7xnhspctupjnih",
        "block_type": 25,
        "children": [
          "VY7odrtZJo2arTxqj6Uck3B1n8b"
        ],
        "grid_column": {
          "width_ratio": 49
